{"id":"ijhy4nw4yvkmbh18sy49btf4h","title":"人工智能时代数学教育与创造的未来","originalTitle":"人工智能时代的数学未来 兴趣增长是必然趋势 创造路径在极端阶段也不会去人化的原因","summary":"人工智能不会毁灭人类的前提下，它将降低数学学习门槛，吸引更多人对数学产生兴趣，推动数学教育的发展。未来数学创造领域，尽管人工智能可能在解决现有工具能解决的问题上更高效，但人类的意志和创造性仍将是关键。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=45143&do=blog&id=1560735"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T05:38:24.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T12:01:07.662Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T12:01:07.662Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":24,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"61366dbc-a3b8-437c-8af9-7d6e4a7c5ead","title":"杨昊飞提出AI对数学教育及创造的双向影响"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"61366dbc-a3b8-437c-8af9-7d6e4a7c5ead","title":"杨昊飞提出AI对数学教育及创造的双向影响"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fmeAmf__mTgA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}